<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Roosevelt returns for his six-month review. Six weeks ago he had a moderate exacerbation with a cold, treated at a same-day visit with five days of prednisone 40 mg. The nurse telephone check three days later found his peak flow back above 500 L/min. He was not seen in clinic within the week afterwards, as his plan advised, because the appointment was never booked. He recovered fully within ten days and returned to training after two weeks. Since then he has had no night waking, no daytime symptoms apart from before training, and peak flows of 580 to 610 L/min. He takes every maintenance dose. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval history</td><td>Moderate exacerbation with a cold six weeks ago; five days of prednisone; full recovery</td></tr><tr><td>Post-exacerbation follow-up</td><td>Telephone check at three days; no clinic review within one week</td></tr><tr><td>Reliever use</td><td>One inhalation before training; none otherwise</td></tr><tr><td>Home peak flow</td><td>580 to 610 L/min</td></tr><tr><td>Adherence</td><td>Full</td></tr><tr><td>Exacerbations in the past 12 months</td><td>Two oral corticosteroid courses: one last winter before controller therapy and one six weeks ago</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.18"/>
    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough, wheeze, or night symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever; energy back to normal</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Negative</td><td>No thirst, sleep disturbance, or mood change after the prednisone course</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>3 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

